    Example event day, demo data only: an open house on Linux with its
    tickets, five presentation places, 21 tracks, a raffle of 7 draws and
    the web app day whose five rooms follow the five places. The people are
    invented, with no surname, organisation or biography taken from a real
    speaker. Dates are stored in UTC: the event is in America/Montreal,
    UTC-5 on that day (standard time).
-->
